{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/a90e13832bb52434ee908dd855810459.poster.avif?t=1766478288\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/a90e13832bb52434ee908dd855810459.webm?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/a90e13832bb52434ee908dd855810459.mp4?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXFIL delivers a distilled, authentic tactical experience where every match challenges your decision-making, teamwork and situational awareness. Built for players who value realism, EXFIL strips away grinding, magical perks and \u2018gear fear\u2019 to focus on pure tactical combat at infantry level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/9200e15d4a418d8d4c0865f1b9e24b25.poster.avif?t=1766478288\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/9200e15d4a418d8d4c0865f1b9e24b25.webm?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/9200e15d4a418d8d4c0865f1b9e24b25.mp4?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access release includes four intense extraction game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Classic Extraction</strong>: Compete to secure intel and escape. Only one team will make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Search And Destroy</strong>: One team must work together to locate and destroy multiple anti-air defense systems positioned across the map, while the opposing team\u2019s objective is to protect these assets at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>VIP</strong>: One team must defend their high-value target, while the opposing team\u2019s mission is to locate and eliminate the VIP before the match ends.\u00a0<br>\u2022 <strong>Rogue Extraction</strong>: A high-stakes asymmetrical mode where a small rogue team of must outmaneuver a larger force to escape with valuable intel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXFIL\u2019s objective-based gameplay is fast-paced and straight to the point, offering infantry combat that balances realism with accessibility. Whether playing solo, teaming up with friends, or squaring off against other players, you\u2019ll experience scenarios that demand tight communication, calculated movement, and sharp tactical skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just other players you\u2019ll have to contend with - local forces are organized into squads that dynamically patrol, guard key locations, and actively hunt down threats across the map, keeping every match unpredictable and dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive and Dynamic Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across seven handcrafted maps featuring dense forests, industrial zones, military camps and tropical jungles. With a 24-hour day/night cycle and fully simulated weather systems, matches are always unpredictable and ever-changing. Sandstorms, fog, and rainstorms will push your adaptability and \u2018on-the-fly\u2019 team tactics to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/0d8c096e4d9e7e049b6f1eeb85e335b0.poster.avif?t=1766478288\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/0d8c096e4d9e7e049b6f1eeb85e335b0.webm?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/0d8c096e4d9e7e049b6f1eeb85e335b0.mp4?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hardcore Realism, No Nonsense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXFIL\u2019s fully simulated ballistics model accounts for bullet drop, penetration and ricochet. Combine this with realistic player movement, weapon handling, and VOIP-enhanced communication - including proximity chat, and every match becomes a test of skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/45973c627133ad235b74d302ef2e98fb.poster.avif?t=1766478288\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/45973c627133ad235b74d302ef2e98fb.webm?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/45973c627133ad235b74d302ef2e98fb.mp4?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u2981\t</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/e77a53fac80ed3619b83940c1d6d5fa9.avif?t=1766478288\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras_big/e77a53fac80ed3619b83940c1d6d5fa9.avif?t=1766478288 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a dedicated Discord community of over 3,000 members, EXFIL is constantly evolving based on player feedback. Self-hosted servers and dedicated hosting options give you precise control over gameplay rules and settings, whilst detailed after-action reviews allow teams to analyze every hit, shot, and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/773cd2ff28c3b03f59521d3bc7e019f0.poster.avif?t=1766478288\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/773cd2ff28c3b03f59521d3bc7e019f0.webm?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/773cd2ff28c3b03f59521d3bc7e019f0.mp4?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/6a2997fd14fc9382f25d0a5b53af81c2.poster.avif?t=1766478288\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/6a2997fd14fc9382f25d0a5b53af81c2.webm?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/6a2997fd14fc9382f25d0a5b53af81c2.mp4?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sandbox of Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXFIL is more than just its core game modes. Players have the freedom to customize their experience by adjusting a wide range of game parameters - from AI presence on the map to time of day, weather, available weapons, and respawn rules - allowing them to create unique challenges, and playstyles to suit any preference.<br><br>Additional Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC opposition forces<br>Global stats tracking<br>Loadout customization</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access and Beyond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access launch is just the beginning. Over the next 12-18 months, we\u2019re focused on expanding the toolset, adding new features and building a game shaped by the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/ef14da7134371bf478179bcf84f6f74d.poster.avif?t=1766478288\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/ef14da7134371bf478179bcf84f6f74d.webm?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/860020/extras/ef14da7134371bf478179bcf84f6f74d.mp4?t=1766478288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for quick, intense battles or tools to create your own scenarios, EXFIL is your playground for tactical combat <i>without</i> compromise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8bf667b48a1d3515d0c82d838be52d4458329052.jpg","localized_name":"Trial by Fire","name":"Trial by Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/860020/8bf667b48a1d3515d0c82d838be52d4458329052.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/860020?t=1766478288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a